{
  "_what": "Where dream mode reads the week in AI and machine learning (jarvis-os/ainews.js). Every source is AI/ML BY CONSTRUCTION — a lab's own blog, the AI section of a publication, an AI community, Hugging Face's papers and models — so nothing decides by keyword what counts as AI news. Order is priority within a group. group: labs = first-party announcements, big and small; news = AI journalism; field = where new models and papers from unknown labs surface first. kind: rss | atom | hf-papers (one request per day of the week) | hf-models (trending, kept only if created this week). pages: how far a WordPress feed may be paged back (?paged=N) to reach Monday. Checked live 2026-09-18; Anthropic, Meta AI and Mistral publish no feed (404), so their news arrives through the outlets.",
